  "constraints": [
    "Sensor-first 24x18 individual-pad perfboard with 40pin stacking connector directly on Pi. Male pins remain exposed for existing jumper-connected UPS.",
    "Only R1fuel1kohm bench bias and R5brake10kohm are fitted resistors. R3oil bias/F1/F2/C1/C2 remain empty; LK1/LK2 insulated wire links fitted.",
    "J5/J6/J7/R7/R8/C6/D1 are reserved pads only: do not fit parts, headers, wake jumpers W23-W30, charger leads, optocoupler leads, or Pi J2 leads.",
    "No new supply capacitors or I2C pullups. Existing module bypass/pullups relied upon; actual values not yet confirmed.",
    "All unused H1 pins pass through; no carrier wiring to 5V pins2/4 or GPIO17physical11. GPIO27physical13 proposedbrakeinput, liveavailability unverified.",
    "Pi stackingheaderheight, cooler/module/UPSjumper clearance and mounting have not been physically verified. This is not a formally compliant HAT.",
    "No external3.3V supply when stacked. Disconnect all Pi power before fitting/removing carrier or module.",
    "Solder insulated jumper ends beside component leads at underside pads. Crossings/bends remain insulated. Bare power/groundbuses continuous straightwire solderedatlistedtaps.",
    "Fuel original99Miata sender with originalgaugedisconnected. User110ohms observedVERYempty. Publishedfactoryinspectionpoints7/32.5/95ohms notexactfuelvolume curve.",
    "OilDweekiyB07ZYWMV89 one-wire bodygrounded sender; curve/bias unresolved. FitJ3connector ifdesired but leaveoil sensor unplugged and R3empty. Do not use ECUoilpressuretransducer here.",
    "Brake99Miata reservoir isolatedswitch: open aboveMIN closedbelowMIN; disconnectedwire also readsnormal. ConfigureGPIOasinput.",
    "No validated automotive overvoltage/transientprotection or physicalelectricaltest. Knownresistorbenchtests and actualgroundreference checks precedevehicleuse.",
    "Existing virtualkeyGPIO17 route is digital, notproof of numericTSDashingestion. Numericchannelintegration remainsunproven.",
    "Automaticshutdown was disabled atuserrequest2026-10-18; preserve thatsetting. RevD doesnotchangePipowerpolicy."
  ],
